⍝ Blake McBride's Bugs40 ⌹[X] (polynomial) and ⎕MX items (the latter need
⍝ libgsl and come last).




      ⍝ Bugs40 #16: A ⌹[12] B with a term outside the order planes, or without
      ⍝ the order plane of B




      A←4 1⍴0 0 0 1 ◊ B←2 3⍴0 0 1 1 0 0




      OA←-⎕IO-(⍴A)⍴⍳×/⍴A ◊ OB←-⎕IO-(⍴B)⍴⍳×/⍴B




      ((2,⍴A)⍴(,A),,OA) ⌹[12] (2,⍴B)⍴(,B),,OB
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ((2,⍴A)⍴(,A),,OA)⌹[12](2,⍴B)⍴(,B),,OB
      ^                ^

      )MORE
A ⌹[12] B: the order of a term of the division (with exponents 2 2) is not defined by the order planes of A and B



      ((2,⍴A)⍴(,A),,OA) ⌹[12] 1 2 2⍴0 1 1 0
LENGTH ERROR+
      ((2,⍴A)⍴(,A),,OA)⌹[12]1 2 2⍴0 1 1 0
      ^                ^

      )MORE
A ⌹.poly_divideN B : Bad shape of argument B (expecting ↑⍴B = 2, for B[1;...]=polynomial and B[2;...]=monomial order)



