      ⍝ Bugs40 #48, #94: ⌹[11] (scan polynomial): a ¯ belongs to the next number
      ⍝ only, malformed terms are a DOMAIN ERROR, coefficients ≥ 2⋆63 are floats




      ⌹[11] ⌹[7] 1 ¯3
1 ¯3



      ⌹[11] '¯1 + 2x + 3x²'
¯1 2 3



      ⌹[11] '¯3J2'
¯3J2



      ⌹[11] '1J¯1x + 3'
3 1J¯1



      ⌹[11] '3x4'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⌹[11]'3x4'
      ^

      )MORE
⌹[11]B: malformed term in polynomial B: 3x4



      ⌹[11] 'J'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⌹[11]'J'
      ^

      ⌹[11] '-'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⌹[11]'-'
      ^

      ⌹[11] '1E19'
1E19



