      ⍝ Bugs40 #63 (from Bugs40_CD.tc): a ⎕MX subfunction number beyond int




      ⎕MX[4294967297 0] 2 2⍴1 2 3 4
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕MX[4294967297 0]2 2⍴1 2 3 4
      ^

      )MORE
⎕MX[X] B: invalid subfunction number X (= 4294967297).
See: ⎕MX '' or: ⎕MX ⍬ for a list of valid numbers.


      )SIC

